SOAPBOX: SUNSDR DX, SDC log from Yuri. Antennas: Yagi, Dipole, Vertical. Started late on Saturday and set up the radio and logging.
SOAPBOX: The main goal was to test the station in Norway using remote. I worked 440 QSOs from our vacation home in Cartagena, Colombia. A lot of fun and good learning!
SOAPBOX: I operated mostly S&P since I wasn't completely confident in how the remote setup would perform with the internet connection. Great experience, and plenty of new things learned
